			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 240210101,
					"content": "Ow... Why is that box so heavy...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chalmet"
				},
				{
					"id": 240210102,
					"content": "Are you okay?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240210103,
					"content": "We meet again, Honorary Senior Researcher. I apologize... My... my lower back seems to have been injured, it hurts so badly...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chalmet"
				},
				{
					"id": 240210104,
					"content": "I was planning to move a box over here and organize the materials inside.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chalmet"
				},
				{
					"id": 240210105,
					"content": "I... I never imagined the box would be so heavy, and I couldn't quite keep my footing when I lifted it, so all the strain went straight to my waist...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chalmet"
				},
				{
					"id": 240210106,
					"content": "Now I... It feels like my waist is broken, ow...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210107,
						240210108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chalmet"
				},
				{
					"id": 240210107,
					"content": "Need me to carry you to a doctor?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240210109,
					"content": "No, no need... I've hurt my lower back before, I just need to rest a bit...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chalmet"
				},
				{
					"id": 240210110,
					"content": "Paimon wonders just how many files are inside, for it to be this heavy...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 240210111,
					"content": "There must be... Well, a ton of files. After all, the Institute once promoted a style of work called \"Document Everything\" for some time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chalmet"
				},
				{
					"id": 240210112,
					"content": "Basically, it meant that absolutely a single thing at the Institute had to be physically documented.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chalmet"
				},
				{
					"id": 240210113,
					"content": "After they began promoting this policy, the Institute's paper usage increased 5 times...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chalmet"
				},
				{
					"id": 240210114,
					"content": "And because there were so many documents, every single office was forced to create a \"document management\" post just to categorize and sort all the documentation...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chalmet"
				},
				{
					"id": 240210115,
					"content": "So everything had to be written down? That sounds really annoying...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 240210116,
					"content": "It was! Later, that style was slowly phased out, and only implemented to a limited extent.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chalmet"
				},
				{
					"id": 240210117,
					"content": "But let's not discuss that now... Honorary Senior Researcher, can you help me handle the file box? Though my waist hurts, I still need to organize the files inside...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210118,
						240210119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chalmet"
				},
				{
					"id": 240210118,
					"content": "Sure...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 240210119,
					"content": "You just recuperate.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210120
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240210120,
					"content": "No need to worry, I only need my hands to organize documents, I won't hurt my lower back further.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Chalmet"
				},
				{
					"id": 240210108,
					"content": "I can call someone for you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240210109
					]
				}
			]
		},
